Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,And number seven:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:02.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,stopping a jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:04.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,can't stop and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,runs off the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,end of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,the runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,So many airports
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:09.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,add a bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:09.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,of crushable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,concrete blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:12.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,pavement, but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:14.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,light and full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,of bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:16.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under the weight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:18.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,the blocks crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:20.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,The tires sink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,in, like driving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,into deep sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:23.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every block they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:25.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,crush takes away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:25.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,some of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:26.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,the speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:27.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's built to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:27.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolling in at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:29.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,eighty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:29.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:31.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,It has already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,stopped more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:33.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,two dozen planes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,with hundreds of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,people aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:37.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Afterward, crews just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:38.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,replace the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:39.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,crushed blocks.
